    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33890" root="فسو" body-key="f">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَسَا</span></b> , (aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفْسُو</span>, Msb,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَسْوٌ</span> (S, M,
Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُسَآءٌ</span>, (M, K,) or this latter is a
simple subst., (S, Msb,) <i>He emitted a noiseless
wind</i> [or <i>a puff of wind</i>] (Msb, K, TA) <i>from his
anus.</i> (K, * TA.) [Hence the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَسَابَيْنَنَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الظَّرِبَانُ</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَهُم</span>, expl. in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظرب</span>.]

